    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Legacy Era Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Legacy Era Campaign Guide</a></i> </p><p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Heirloom_Items\" title=\"Heirloom Items\">Heirloom Items</a></i> </p><p>When an item possessed by a good person becomes an Heirloom Item, it becomes a beacon of light that staves off the darkness. </p><p>When carrying or using the Heirloom Item, once per encounter, as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reaction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reaction\">Reaction</a>, you can impose a penalty on any one attack roll or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Skill_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Skill Check\">Skill Check</a> made by a character with a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Dark_Side_Score\" title=\"Dark Side Score\">Dark Side Score</a> of 1 or higher. This penalty is equal to the target's <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Dark_Side_Score\" title=\"Dark Side Score\">Dark Side Score</a>. </p>",
